/ DRAFT: written as a starting point, to be reviewed by the owner (ideally with a lawyer) before launch.
/ Keep it in sync with privacy.vi.html.slim (the Vietnamese version prevails).
- content_for :title, "Privacy policy"

article class="card mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 [&_h2]:text-base [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:text-slate-900 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ul]:pl-5"
  header
    h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900" Privacy policy
    p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500" Last updated: 19/10/2026

  p
    | This policy explains how #{@venue.name} (#{@venue.address}) collects and uses your personal data when you use the booking
      website, in line with Vietnam's Decree 13/2023/ND-CP on personal data protection. If the two versions differ, the Vietnamese one prevails.

  section class="space-y-2"
    h2 1. Data we collect
    ul
      li Your name, phone number and email, entered when you sign up or when you book by phone.
      li Your booking history: court, date and time, amount, payment status, notes and cancellations.
      li The language you use on the website, so emails are sent in that language.
      li Technical data such as your IP address and sign-in cookie, only to keep you signed in and to prevent unauthorized access.

  section class="space-y-2"
    h2 2. Why we use it
    ul
      li To manage your bookings and check you in when you arrive.
      li To send account verification, booking confirmation, reminder, cancellation and password reset emails.
      li To contact you when something changes about a booking.
      li To prevent holding or cancelling too many courts, spam and password guessing.
    p We do not use your data for advertising and never sell it.

  section class="space-y-2"
    h2 3. Sharing
    p
      | Your data is only shared with service providers the website needs to run (hosting, email delivery), or with authorities
        when the law requires it.

  section class="space-y-2"
    h2 4. How long we keep it
    p
      | Account data is kept while your account is active. Booking history is kept for up to 2 years after your last booking,
        then deleted or anonymized.

  section class="space-y-2"
    h2 5. Your rights
    ul
      li View and correct your name, phone number and email in your account settings.
      li Download a copy of your data (JSON file) from your account settings.
      li
        | Delete your account from your account settings (or ask the venue to). The account is locked at once; your name, email and phone number
          are removed after your last booking ends. Booking and payment history is kept for the venue's books, without your personal details.
      li Withdraw your consent by contacting the venue. Without consent you can no longer book online.
      li Complain if you believe your data is misused.

  section class="space-y-2"
    h2 6. Contact
    p
      = "#{@venue.name}, #{@venue.address}"
      - if @venue.phone
        = " · Phone: "
        = link_to PhoneNumber.to_local(@venue.phone), "tel:#{@venue.phone}", class: "link"
